  "description": "Tae Jun-Kyung, an executive director at a major construction company, and his secretary, Seo Rin-Ah.\n\nOutwardly, they were an executive and a secretary, but in reality, they shared a secret bed. Rin-Ah willingly gave her body and heart to him simply because she liked him for who he was, even though she knew he had absolutely no interest in dating or marriage. \n\nHowever, to show her father, who had been diagnosed with a terminal illness, that she was getting married, Rin-Ah decided to end her relationship with Jun-Kyung and go on arranged dates. Yet, even that did not go as planned. Every time Rin-Ah went on a date, Tae Jun-Kyung invariably sabotaged it. The one remark he spat out after belatedly awakening to his emotions: \n\n“Then marry me. Marriage is nothing. If you’ve turned a perfectly normal guy into a fool, you have to take responsibility.” \n\nIt was the late awakening of a man who had never known love—he was worthy of being called a madman.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=851683), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14279817)",
